<title>USA: Morton International Inc Q2 Dec 31 net off.</title>
<headline>Morton International Inc Q2 Dec 31 net off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.61		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			 88,100		   99,500</p>
<p> Revs		     943,300		  916,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 145,001		  150,452</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q2 includes non-operating, pretax income of $24.0 million, or $0.10 a share after tax, from environmental insurance settlements. Excluding that, fiscal Q2 1997 earnings per share would have been up nine percent.  </p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.15		    $1.11</p>
<p> Net			166,800		  166,800</p>
<p> Revs		   1,819,200		1,725,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 145,001		  150,452</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding insurance gain in year-ago Q2, earnings for first-half of fiscal 1997 were up 10 percent and earnings per share were up 14 percent. A lower effective tax rate and fewer shares outstanding contributed $0.04 a share in first-half of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
